# Sheet codes — cross-reference

Every issued sheet must carry a code on the title block (row 3:
`ფურცელი:`). The codes below come from the office reference set
(`19_xref_grg/`, `03_xref_saproeqto/`, `04_Xref_saproeqto/`).

## Architectural / structural

| Code | Meaning (Georgian) | Drawing type | Common scale |
|---|---|---|---|
| `ა-NN` | არქიტექტურა | Architectural floor plan, section, elevation | 1 : 50, 1 : 100 |
| `კ-NN` | კონსტრუქცია | Reinforced-concrete construction | 1 : 50 |
| `ფნ-NN` | ფუნდამენტი | Foundation plan | 1 : 50 |
| `გ-NN` | გენგეგმა | Site / general plan | 1 : 200, 1 : 500 |
| `ფ-NN` | ფასადი | Elevation | 1 : 100 |
| `ჭ-NN` | ჭრილი | Section | 1 : 50, 1 : 100 |
| `ი-NN` | ინტერიერი | Interior layout | 1 : 50 |

## GRG (general regulation plan) sheets

| Code | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `FZ-1` … `FZ-8` | ფუნქციური ზონა — functional zone |
| `MZL-FZ` / `MZL-SZ` / `MZL-TSZ` | მიწათსარგებლობის ზონა — land-use overlays |
| `CIG` / `CIP` / `CIS` / `CIW` | building footprint / parking / staircase / waste |
| `CIR-1` / `CIR-2` | recreation / green areas |
| `CTS-12` | transport / traffic |
| `CVC-4` | vehicle circulation |
| `CZLSZ` / `CZVCNZ` | utility / engineering zones |

## Expected xrefs per sheet code

| Sheet | Required xrefs |
|---|---|
| `გ-NN` (gengegma) | `xref_topo`, `xref_sakutreba`, `xref_shenobebi`, `xref_gzebi`, `xref_gantavseba` |
| `FZ-N` | `xref_zonireba`, `xref_gengegma`, `xref_topo`, `xref_sakutreba` |
| `ა-NN` | (no xref — pure architecture) |
| `კ-NN` | optional `xref_arxitektura.dwg` underlay |
| `MZL-…` | `xref_zonireba`, `xref_topo`, parcel cadastre |
| `CIG` / `CIP` | `xref_gantavseba`, `xref_topo`, optional `xref_miwisqvesha_parkingi` |
| `CIR-N` | `xref_gamwvaneba`, `xref_topo` |
| `CTS-12` | `xref_gzebi da trotuarebi`, `xref_topo` |

## File-naming convention

Issued PDFs follow `GRG to PDF-<CODE>.pdf`:

```
GRG to PDF-A1.pdf
GRG to PDF-FZ3.pdf
GRG to PDF-MZLSZ.pdf
GRG to PDF-CIR1.pdf
```

Working DWGs use Georgian transliteration:

```
gengegma-2026-04.dwg
fundamenti-k44.dwg
fasadi-aghmosavleti.dwg
```

## Sheet sizes (mm)

| Format | W × H | Used for |
|---|---|---|
| A4 | 297 × 210 | details |
| A3 | 420 × 297 | small plans, section pieces |
| A2 | 594 × 420 | apartment plans |
| A1 | 841 × 594 | floor / GRG sheets |
| A0 | 1 189 × 841 | site plans, master plan |

## Decision tree

```
Is the drawing about urban regulation?
  ├── Yes → GRG sheet code (FZ-, MZL-, CI-, CT-, CV-, CZ-)
  └── No
       ├── Concrete/steel structure?      → კ-NN
       ├── Foundation only?                → ფნ-NN
       ├── Architectural plan/sect/elev?   → ა-NN
       ├── Interior?                       → ი-NN
       └── Whole site?                     → გ-NN (also exists as GRG `g-`)
```
